{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "DryDepositionGas",
    "description": "Gas-phase dry deposition, upstream `DryDepositionGasFractional` (Wesely 1989 surface resistance with fractional / mosaic land use). For each of 132 species the deposition velocity is the area-weighted sum over the 11 Wesely land-use classes, v = i_lev * sum_c f_c / (Ra + Rb + Rc_c) (the GEOS-Chem drydep_mod / CMAQ STAGE convention), and the rate is k = v*g*rho_A/del_P. Inputs: the 11 area fractions f_<class>, the season index, and surface meteorology (z, z0, u_star, L, rho_A, G, Ts, theta, lev, del_P). 0-D and stateless.",
    "authors": ["AtmosphericDeposition.jl / DepositionMTK.jl contributors", "EarthSciModels"],
    "created": "2026-10-28T00:00:00Z",
    "tags": [
      "atmospheric_deposition",
      "dry-deposition",
      "wesley-1989",
      "mosaic-land-use",
      "multi-species",
      "gas-phase"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Wesely, M. L. (1989). Parameterization of surface resistances to gaseous dry deposition in regional-scale numerical models. Atmospheric Environment 23(6), 1293-1304. doi:10.1016/0004-6981(89)90153-4"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Seinfeld, J. H., & Pandis, S. N. (2006). Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics (2nd ed.). Wiley. Eqs. 19.13-19.14 (aerodynamic resistance), 19.17 (quasi-laminar resistance for gases)."
      },
      {
        "citation": "GEOS-Chem drydep_mod.F90: area-weighted deposition velocity over land types and the 1 s/m floors on r_ac and r_gs."
      },
      {
        "citation": "Source: jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only), src/dry_deposition.jl, src/wesley1989.jl."
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "DryDepositionGas": {
      "reference": {
        "notes": "source_ref: jialinl6/DepositionMTK.jl@cbe7d7db (branch superfast-gas-only):src/dry_deposition.jl DryDepositionGasFractional / DryDepGasFractional, src/wesley1989.jl WesleySurfaceResistance / FractionalWesleyVd.\n\nWhat changed against the previous revision (AtmosphericDeposition.jl@e4468c79 DryDepositionGas): the single `landuse` index is replaced by the 11 area fractions f_<class>; r_s keeps its hot-closure guard (stomata closed at Ts >= 39.9 °C - the old code re-evaluated eq. 3 and discarded it, so r_s went negative above 40 °C); r_ac and r_gsS are floored at 1 s/m (GEOS-Chem drydep_mod.F90), which matters for water and wetland where the tables hold 0.\n\nStructure: the class- and species-independent pieces (Ra, mu_air, Dh2o, rdc, correction) and, per class, the seven Wesely table entries at the current season and the stomatal resistance rs_<class> are shared observeds; each species carries RaRb_<s> = Ra + Rb and v_<s> inlines the 11 class surface resistances with its GasData (Dh2oPerDx, Hstar, Fo) substituted. rain and dew are false, as upstream hardcodes them, so r_lux = r_lu/(1e-5*Hstar + Fo). SO2 and O3 use the SO2 / O3 table columns for r_cl and r_gs, as upstream. Table lookups are interp.linear on the integer season knots, which returns the entry exactly; upstream indexes at round(Int, season), so season must be an integer.\n\nNot in this component: where the inputs come from. Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling (ext/EarthSciDataExt.jl) sets z to the hypsometric first-level midpoint height, del_P to the first-level pressure thickness (-4.804826 Pa + 0.015048*PS), season from the month, and the 11 fractions from the bundled CONUS land-use map; in EarthSciModels a host model does that wiring.\n\nTolerance rationale (rel = 1e-9): expected values are upstream's own DryDepGasFractional evaluated at the test inputs; the ESM repeats the same Float64 arithmetic on the same Float32-stored tables."
      },
      "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-09},
      "variables": {
        "season": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1,
          "description": "Wesely (1989) season index: 1 midsummer, 2 autumn, 3 late autumn, 4 winter, 5 transitional spring. An integer, as upstream's Int parameter; upstream's GEOS-FP coupling sets it from the month (season_at: Jun-Aug 1, Sep-Oct 2, Nov 3, Dec-Feb 4, Mar-May 5)."
        },
        "z": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 60.0,
          "description": "Reference height for the aerodynamic resistance: the mid-point of level 1 [m]. Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling uses the hypsometric first-level midpoint height."
        },
        "del_P": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "Pa",
          "default": 1520.0,
          "description": "Pressure thickness of level 1 [Pa], for k = v*g*rho_A/del_P."
        },
        "z0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.04,
          "description": "Surface roughness length [m]. Upstream z₀."
        },
        "u_star": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.44, "description": "Friction velocity [m/s]."},
        "L": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Monin-Obukhov length [m]; L = 0 is the neutral-stability sentinel."
        },
        "rho_A": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "default": 1.2,
          "description": "Air density [kg/m^3]. Upstream ρA."
        },
        "G": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "W/m^2",
          "default": 300.0,
          "description": "Solar irradiation at the surface [W/m^2]."
        },
        "Ts": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 298.0,
          "description": "Surface air temperature [K]; the Wesely resistances use Ts_c = Ts - 273."
        },
        "theta": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Slope of the local terrain [radians]. Upstream θ."
        },
        "lev": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1,
          "description": "Model level index; deposition acts only at lev == 1."
        },
        "f_urban": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 1 (urban). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_agricultural": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 2 (agricultural). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_range": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 3 (range). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_deciduous": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 4 (deciduous). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_coniferous": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 5 (coniferous). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_mixedforest": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 6 (mixedforest). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_water": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 7 (water). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_barren": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 8 (barren). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_wetland": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 9 (wetland). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_rangeag": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 10 (rangeag). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "f_rockyshrubs": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Area fraction of Wesely (1989) land-use class 11 (rockyshrubs). Upstream's GEOS-FP coupling binds the 11 fractions to a MODIS MCD12C1 (2016) CONUS 0.05° land-use map conservatively regridded onto the model grid; they should sum to 1. Upstream default: mixed forest 1, the rest 0."
        },
        "g_const": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s^2",
          "default": 9.81,
          "description": "Gravitational acceleration [m/s^2]. Upstream @constants g."
        },
        "kappa": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.4,
          "description": "Von Karman constant. Upstream @constants κ."
        },
        "Ts_c": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "degC",
          "description": "Surface air temperature in °C, Ts - 273 (upstream Ts*T_unitless - 273)."
        },
        "L2_eps": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m^2",
          "description": "L^2 + 1e-300: lets zeta = z*L/L2_eps reproduce upstream's ifelse(L == 0, 0, z/L) without dividing by zero."
        },
        "zeta": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Stability parameter z/L (0 when L = 0)."},
        "zeta_0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Stability parameter z0/L (0 when L = 0)."},
        "ra_neutral_stable": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Aerodynamic resistance for neutral or stable conditions (upstream rₐ_1)."
        },
        "i_unstable": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "1 when unstable (zeta < 0), else 0."},
        "eta_0": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "(1 - 15*zeta_0)^(1/4), unstable only."},
        "eta": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "(1 - 15*zeta)^(1/4), unstable only."},
        "Ra": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Aerodynamic resistance [s/m] (upstream ra(z, z₀, u_star, L))."
        },
        "mu_air": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "kg/(m*s)",
          "description": "Dynamic viscosity of air [kg/(m*s)] (upstream mu)."
        },
        "Dh2o": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m^2/s",
          "description": "Molecular diffusivity of water vapour in air [m^2/s] (upstream dH2O)."
        },
        "i_lev": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "1 at level 1, else 0 (upstream i = ifelse(lev == 1, 1, 0))."
        },
        "rdc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Buoyant-convection mixing resistance [s/m], Wesely (1989) eq. 5 (upstream r_dc)."
        },
        "correction": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cold-surface correction [s/m] added to r_lux, r_clx and r_gsx below 0 °C (Wesely 1989 p. 4)."
        },
        "r_i_urban": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
